{
  "post": {
    "id": "5772153",
    "published": "2016-04-25T09:15:52.000Z",
    "title": "海は広いな大きかったな！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/5772153.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160428002141/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/5772153.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんばんは、鹿乃です ⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "晚上好，我是鹿乃 ⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good evening, I'm Kano ⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今日はラジオ収録とボイトレに行ってきました。寝不足と微妙な暑さでへろへろです。おすすめの疲労回復方法や癒し系グッズがあったらぜひ教えてください！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天去录了广播节目，还去上了发声训练课。因为睡眠不足，加上这不凉不热的闷热天气，整个人都累瘫了。大家如果有推荐的恢复疲劳的方法或者治愈系小物，请一定要告诉我！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Today I went to a radio recording and voice training. I'm exhausted from lack of sleep and the awkward warmth. If you have any recommended ways to recover from fatigue or soothing goods, please tell me!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "ffd649212689.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/a/c/acd5bff4.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "26b09a325e3f.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/5/b/5bcd38a1.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ブログ書くなら写真か画像を…というこだわりのある鹿乃なのですが、ネタになりそうな写真を今日は撮ってない！ので、今年頭に立ち寄った熱海の写真をぺたりとしてみました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我是那种写博客就一定要配上照片或图片、有点讲究的鹿乃，不过今天没拍到什么能当素材的照片！所以就把今年年初顺路去的热海的照片贴出来啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Kano is particular about having a photo or image when she writes a blog post... but I didn't take any photos today that could make good material! So I've plastered in a photo from Atami, where I stopped by at the start of this year."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "長いこと海辺の街で暮らしていたので、こうしてたまに海をみると妙に懐かしい気持ちになります。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "因为曾经在海边的城市生活了很久，所以像这样偶尔看看海，心里就会涌起一种莫名的怀念。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I lived in a seaside town for a long time, so whenever I see the sea like this, I feel strangely nostalgic."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京にいるとなかなか海をみることないからね！なにより滅多に出歩かないからね笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在东京的话平时很难看到海嘛！而且我也很少出门，哈哈。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You hardly ever see the sea when you're in Tokyo! And above all, I hardly ever go out lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いい感じにしんみり？したところで、先日公開された特典関係について質問がいくつかありましたので補足のお話をさせてください( ´⚰︎` )"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "正当气氛恰到好处地变得有些感伤？的时候——关于前几天公开的特典，我收到了几个提问，所以请让我在这里补充说明一下( ´⚰︎` )"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now that things have turned nicely sentimental(?), I'd like to add some explanations, because there were several questions about the bonus information that was revealed the other day ( ´⚰︎` )"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "8c1d905c0b22.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/3/a/3a4fba7a.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆特典は通販で購入してもつくの？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆通过通贩购买也能拿到特典吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆ Do I get the bonus if I buy by mail order?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "先着順になりますがついてきます。詳しくは「nowhere/鹿乃」の各店舗さんの通販ページに特典について書いてくださっているのでご参照ください。どうしても不安な場合はお店にお問い合わせして確認していただくと確実ですっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "会有的，不过按先到先得。至于详情，各家店铺都在自己“nowhere／鹿乃”的通贩页面上写明了特典内容，请参考一下。如果实在不放心，直接向店家咨询确认一下最稳妥哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yes, you do, though it's first come, first served. The details about the bonuses are written on each store's mail-order page for \"nowhere/Kano\", so please refer to those. If you're really worried, it's safest to contact the store and check!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆汎用特典はどこでもらえるの？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆通用特典在哪里能拿到？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆ Where can I get the generic bonus?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "チェーン特典実地店さん以外です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在连锁特典的指定店铺以外的地方都能拿到。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At any store other than the ones running a chain-store bonus."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "例えば、amazonさんとか！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "比如 amazonさん 之类的！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For example, Amazon!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "【早期購入特典あり】nowhere(メーカー特典:オリジナルポストカード(汎用ver.))",
            "source": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eVw0AhK-L._SL160_.jpg",
            "media": "48b0ee01baff.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B01DSN3MU0",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "【早期購入特典あり】nowhere(メーカー特典:オリジナルポストカード(汎用ver.)) [CD]"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2016-05-11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆B2告知ポスターの入手方法は？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆B2宣传海报要怎么才能拿到？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆ How can I get the B2 announcement poster?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "B2告知ポスターは店舗さんに飾ってありますよ〜なもので特典ではありません。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "B2宣传海报是装饰在店里的东西哦～，并不是特典。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The B2 announcement poster is something the stores put on display, so it isn't a bonus."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆アニメイト特典CDは何曲入ってるの？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆アニメイト特典CD里收录了几首歌？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆ How many songs are on the Animate bonus CD?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "リマスタリング版の「小夜子」が一曲収録されています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "收录了重制版《小夜子》一首歌。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It contains one song, the remastered version of \"Sayoko\"."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆リリイベの参加券はまだある？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆发售活动的参加券还有吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆ Are there still tickets for the release events?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "22日のとらのあなさんぶんは、秋葉原店Bさんと新宿店Aさんが終了して池袋店Bさんのみ若干まだあるようです！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "22日とらのあな的份额，秋叶原店B和新宿店A已经没有了，好像只有池袋店B还剩一些！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For the 22nd's Toranoana events, Akihabara Store B and Shinjuku Store A are finished, and it seems only Ikebukuro Store B still has a few left!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "なので今から予約する方で確実にリリイベ参加券をゲットしたいという方は、TSUTAYAさん、アニメイトさん、タワーレコードさんに行っていただくといいかもしれません！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "所以如果是现在才想预约、又希望能稳稳拿到发售活动参加券的朋友，去TSUTAYA、アニメイト或タワーレコード看看或许会比较好！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So if you're reserving from now and want to be sure to get a release event ticket, it might be best to go to TSUTAYA, Animate or Tower Records!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "各店舗さまごとの詳細は下記URLよりご確認ください(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "各店铺的详细情况请通过下方的网址确认(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please check the details for each store at the URL below (﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
