        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "文字数びっしりで見づらかったかもですね！ごめんなさい！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "文字排得密密麻麻的，可能不太好读吧！对不起啦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It might have been hard to read, with the text packed in so tightly! Sorry!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ではでは、鹿乃でした〜またね⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么那么，我是鹿乃～下次见⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Well then, that was Kano~ See you!⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
